<p>
  {dgettext("help_space", "Every space also has an office.")}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "It already has furniture, and everyone in the conversation can add more."
  )}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Only the people of the conversation can go in.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Going in and out")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "The wooden door stands on the central island of the End of Time, next to the green gate."
  )}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Walk up to the door and press E.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "It asks if you want to enter.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Answer %{yes} to go in.", yes: dgettext("chat", "Yes"))}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "The way out is the wooden door by the reception."
  )}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "On a touch screen, the hand button of the on-screen controls does the same as E."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "What is already there")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "There is a reception by the door, desks with computers, a meeting table and a small kitchen."
  )}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "The meeting table and the kitchen are behind glass walls."
  )}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Press E next to a glass door to open it, and again to close it.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Press F next to a chair to sit down.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Press E next to a lamp to turn its light on or off.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Press E next to the screen to see the last picture posted.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "This furniture is part of the office.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "This furniture cannot be moved, turned or removed.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Adding pieces")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Press %{build} in the top-left corner, or B, to see the pieces.",
    build: dgettext("chat", "Build")
  )}
  {dgettext("help_space", "The Build menu shows the office pieces first.")}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Any piece from the Construct can also be placed in the office."
  )}
  {dgettext("help_space", "They are placed, moved and painted the same way.")}
  <.help_link topic="feature-space-construct">
    {dgettext("help_space", "The Construct")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Together")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_space", "Everyone inside sees each change at once.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "The office keeps everything that was added to it.")}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Like the Construct, the office is part of the space's gathering."
  )}
</p>
